.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-create 1  "quarters-create " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-create \- Create a private, persistent space
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-create\fR [\fB\-\-shell\fR] [\fB\-\-layout\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-host\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-host\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-confirm\-plan\fR] [\fB\-\-replace\-generated\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a private, persistent space
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-shell\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Default absolute shell path. Uses the host SHELL or /bin/sh
.TP
\fB\-\-layout\fR \fI<LAYOUT>\fR [default: profile]
User\-directory layout to create
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
profile: Minimal shell and CLI state profile
.IP \(bu 2
workspace: Expanded home with common personal and platform directories
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-host\fR \fI<FROM_HOST>\fR
Preview or import a closed set of host\-owned state
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
shell: Selected startup and editing convention files; no credentials or history
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-host\-path\fR \fI<RELATIVE_PATH>\fR
Add one explicit regular file beneath host HOME (maximum 32)
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Validate and print the exact metadata\-bound host\-fork plan
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\-plan\fR \fI<DIGEST>\fR
Execute only the exact 64\-hex digest returned by preview
.TP
\fB\-\-replace\-generated\fR
Replace generated files selected by the confirmed plan
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Portable space name: letters, numbers, hyphens or underscores
